	"description": "P36 (plan M6-M9 §5.10, event.siege_of_skarn): the toll-riders' siege line east of Skarn - the crews of its five engines (three catapults with two crews each, two ballistae with one; the engines themselves are placed props that appear when the siege starts, ConditionSpawn), a pike formation and a shield formation of eight and their banners before the engines, and four cavalry behind them (faction toll_riders: hostile). The engines bombard Skarn's longhouses (prop_targets) while the giant is within 200 m of the steading; when the line's last engine falls its soldiers rout (SiegeEngine's siege_group) - so no crewman need die for Skarn to be saved. It stands where the event puts it (its own centre).",
